1
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:03,040
亲爱的
Honey?

2
00:00:04,698 --> 00:00:05,586
你记得给艾丽克斯
Did you remember to give Alex

3
00:00:05,586 --> 00:00:06,554
和卢克午饭钱了吗
and Luke their lunch money?

4
00:00:06,554 --> 00:00:07,542
记得 长官
Ma'am, yes, ma'am.

5
00:00:07,542 --> 00:00:09,268
电工呢 你给他支票了吗
What about the electrician? Did you give him a check?

6
00:00:09,268 --> 00:00:11,035
他是电工 他会给我们收费[充电]
He's an electrician -- he'll charge us.

7
00:00:11,035 --> 00:00:12,552
我上班要迟到了 石基[喜剧演员]
I'm gonna be late for work, Shecky.

8
00:00:12,552 --> 00:00:13,889
当然了 我付钱给他了
Yes, I paid him.

9
00:00:13,889 --> 00:00:15,336
顺便说句 情人节快乐
Happy Valentine's, by the way.

10
00:00:15,336 --> 00:00:16,094
不行
Mm, no.

11
00:00:16,094 --> 00:00:17,701
跑完步都是汗 恶心死了
Gross and sweaty from running.

12
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,140
今晚的计划
So for later tonight,

13
00:00:20,575 --> 00:00:22,341
你跟我想的一样吗 我的情人
You thinking what I'm thinking, Valentine?

14
00:00:22,341 --> 00:00:24,616
我相信是一样的
I believe I am.

15
00:00:25,035 --> 00:00:25,983
每次情人节
Every Valentine's day,

16
00:00:25,983 --> 00:00:28,398
克莱尔和我都会玩点儿刺激的角色扮演
Claire and I look forward to some naughty role-playing --

17
00:00:28,398 --> 00:00:31,532
性感狂野的奸夫淫妇朱莉安娜
sexually adventurous cuckolder Juliana

18
00:00:31,572 --> 00:00:32,729
和克里夫·比克斯比
and Clive Bixby,

19
00:00:32,729 --> 00:00:35,424
白天是扬声器推销员 晚上变身间谍
speaker salesman by day, spy by night.

20
00:00:35,424 --> 00:00:37,220
同时也是情人
Lover also by night

21
00:00:37,220 --> 00:00:39,405
有时候白天也是
and sometimes during the day.

22
00:00:39,405 --> 00:00:42,210
扬声器生意 基本不用管
The speaker business, it -- it pretty much runs itself.

23
00:00:42,279 --> 00:00:44,575
我希望今年非常低调
I just want to keep it really low-key this year.

24
00:00:44,575 --> 00:00:45,773
简单就好
You know, simple.

25
00:00:46,022 --> 00:00:46,741
行
Yep.

26
00:00:46,920 --> 00:00:48,520
另一方面
On the other hand,

27
00:00:48,520 --> 00:00:49,300
我们也可以去
we could have

28
00:00:49,300 --> 00:00:50,840
我们喜欢的那家旅馆酒吧喝一杯
a drink at that hotel bar we love.

29
00:00:50,980 --> 00:00:51,700
接着说
Go on.

30
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:53,600
然后直接回家
And come straight home...

31
00:00:54,220 --> 00:00:55,160
穿上睡衣裤
Put on our Jammies,

32
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:57,020
看着电视渐渐入睡
and fall asleep in front of the TV.

33
00:00:57,340 --> 00:00:57,820
完美
Perfect.

34
00:00:57,820 --> 00:00:59,920
已经好期待了
Looking forward to it already.

35
00:01:00,820 --> 00:01:02,040
但不要穿我讨厌的那些
Ew, but not those ones I hate,

36
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:03,220
红缎子睡衣
those red satin pajamas.

37
00:01:03,220 --> 00:01:04,720
我都不知道那些在哪儿
I don't even know where those are.

38
00:01:18,540 --> 00:01:20,020
我知道我会放下的
I know I'll get over it,

39
00:01:20,020 --> 00:01:21,680
但现在我真的好讨厌安德斯和库珀
but right now I hate Anders and Cooper.

40
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,960
我们亲爱的朋友安德斯和库珀
Our dear friends Anders and Cooper

41
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:26,920
去年情人节结婚了
got married last Valentine's Day,

42
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,800
我们想送他们点特别的礼物
and we wanted to get them something really special.

43
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,620
我们找到了一副精美的小油画
We found this exquisite little painting...

44
00:01:31,620 --> 00:01:32,980
画上是我们去年在纳帕
...of a winery in Napa

45
00:01:32,980 --> 00:01:34,620
一起参观的一座酒庄
that we all visited last year.

46
00:01:34,780 --> 00:01:36,900
有一点点...贵
It was a...bit pricey,

47
00:01:37,025 --> 00:01:38,163
但他们很挑剔
but they're really judge-y

48
00:01:38,163 --> 00:01:39,580
我们知道他们一定会喜欢的
and we knew they'd love it.

49
00:01:39,580 --> 00:01:41,167
问题是 我们也喜欢
The problem is, so did we.

50
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:42,200
谢谢 卡尔梅利纳
Thank you, Carmelina.

51
00:01:43,721 --> 00:01:46,286
这里有个礼物麻烦你
Oh, and here's s-something you can...

52
00:01:46,326 --> 00:01:47,484
放到其他房间
put in the other room.

53
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,520
-好艰难 -太艰难了
- That was hard. - So hard.

54
00:01:49,660 --> 00:01:51,140
也许莉莉的亲生母亲当初也是这感觉
Probably how Lily's birth mother felt.

55
00:01:51,220 --> 00:01:52,080
但是我们可没有
Except we don't have nine

56
00:01:52,080 --> 00:01:53,640
另外五位画家画的九幅油画
other paintings by five different painters.

57
00:01:53,700 --> 00:01:55,640
天呐 米奇 小卡
Oh, my God. Mitch, Cam.

58
00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:56,780
天呐 我们来早了吗
Oh, God, are we early?

59
00:01:57,004 --> 00:01:57,832
-这可不是我们的风格 -很抱歉
- This is so not like us. - I'm sorry.

60
00:01:57,832 --> 00:01:59,897
不不不 派对已经取消了
No, no, no. The party's been canceled.

61
00:01:59,897 --> 00:02:01,674
-为什么 -库珀把我甩了
- Why? - Cooper's left me.

62
00:02:01,674 --> 00:02:03,380
他正在申请离婚
He's filing for divorce.

63
00:02:03,390 --> 00:02:04,808
我们结束了
The marriage is over!

64
00:02:06,364 --> 00:02:08,729
-安德斯 -安德斯
- Ohh, Anders. - Anders.

65
00:02:09,128 --> 00:02:10,885
我还以为我们是相爱的
I thought we were in love.

66
00:02:10,934 --> 00:02:13,838
你以为你了解睡在隔壁房间的那个人
You think you know the person sleeping in the next bedroom.

67
00:02:14,640 --> 00:02:15,680
我去给你们拿点酒
I'll get us some drinks.

68
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:19,480
好可怜
So sad.

69
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:20,820
是啊 也不一定
Yeah, it doesn't have to be.

70
00:02:21,460 --> 00:02:22,300
如果是真爱
If it's really love,

71
00:02:22,300 --> 00:02:23,880
你就要尽一切可能争取回
you do everything you need to do to get back

72
00:02:23,880 --> 00:02:24,600
你曾经拥有的一切
what you once had.

73
00:02:24,600 --> 00:02:26,260
你在说那幅画吧
You're talking about the painting, right?

74
00:02:26,432 --> 00:02:28,069
当然了 因为我们不欠他什么了
Of course I am 'cause we don't owe him that anymore.

75
00:02:28,069 --> 00:02:28,787
-去拿吧 -好了
- Go get it! - Okay.

76
00:02:28,787 --> 00:02:29,896
快去拿
Go get it.

77
00:02:30,180 --> 00:02:31,600
你今天一定有什么重大计划吧
You must have big plans today.

78
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:33,000
这节日简直就是你的超级碗大赛
This is like your Super Bowl, right?

79
00:02:33,228 --> 00:02:34,884
今年我不打算采取行动
I'm sitting it out this year.

80
00:02:34,884 --> 00:02:37,010
这个节日已经商业化到可笑的地步了
The whole holiday's gotten laughably commercial.

81
00:02:37,010 --> 00:02:38,746
看来你被艾米拒绝了
Sounds like Amy turned you down.

82
00:02:38,746 --> 00:02:40,782
就像豪华酒店的床一样
Like a bed in a five-star hotel.

83
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:42,140
我要慢慢地在
I'll be drowning my sorrows

84
00:02:42,319 --> 00:02:44,544
我的新欢罪案剧中忘掉我的悲伤
in a marathon of my new favorite true-crime show,

85
00:02:44,544 --> 00:02:45,883
《致命女士》
"Lethal Ladies."

86
00:02:46,251 --> 00:02:47,468
艾米也许是甩了我
Amy may have dumped me,

87
00:02:47,468 --> 00:02:48,865
但至少不是从嘉年华游轮的甲板上
but at least it wasn't off the lido deck

88
00:02:48,865 --> 00:02:49,843
把我的尸体甩出去
of a Carnival Cruise.

89
00:02:49,843 --> 00:02:51,330
我知道 桑娅
I know, Sonia.

90
00:02:51,800 --> 00:02:54,000
瞧瞧谁回来了 桑格利亚姐妹花
Look who's back -- the Sangria sisters.

91
00:02:54,640 --> 00:02:56,000
我邀请我妹妹来作客
I invited my sister to visit

92
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,660
好解决我们之间的矛盾
so that we could fix our problems.

93
00:02:57,920 --> 00:02:59,700
你懂的 姐妹间的小摩擦
You know, sister things,

94
00:02:59,700 --> 00:03:03,180
比如我很讨厌她总是借我的梳子
like I never liked how she always borrowed my brush,

95
00:03:03,180 --> 00:03:04,340
而她也很讨厌
or she never liked

96
00:03:04,340 --> 00:03:06,840
我抢了她离开小村庄的机会
how I stole her one chance to escape the village

97
00:03:06,840 --> 00:03:09,240
而把她留在那里 照顾我母亲
and I left her there, taking care of my mother.

98
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,620
类似的事情
Things like that.

99
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:13,480
杰 桑娅的航班延误到了明天
Jay, they delayed Sonia's flight until tomorrow.

100
00:03:13,580 --> 00:03:15,540
我们何不取消晚餐预订
Why don't we cancel our dinner reservation

101
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:17,860
我们三个一起在家里庆祝情人节
and the three of us celebrate Valentine's here?

102
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,720
你不用为了我这么做 歌洛莉亚
You don't have to do that for me, Gloria.

103
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:22,160
情人节我通常都在
I usually spend Valentine's Day

104
00:03:22,160 --> 00:03:24,500
村子那口井附近卖手工花
selling artificial flowers near the well in my village.

105
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,480
你们都住哪儿啊 《国家地理》杂志吗
Where do you people live, National Geographic?

106
00:03:26,680 --> 00:03:28,060
这样我会很内疚
I just feel so bad.

107
00:03:28,493 --> 00:03:30,369
你们这星期对我这么好
You have both shown me such kindness this week,

108
00:03:30,369 --> 00:03:32,384
我却只给你们带来坏天气
and I repay you with bad weather over Tampa.

109
00:03:32,384 --> 00:03:33,582
不会 这样更好
No, this is better.

110
00:03:33,582 --> 00:03:34,700
外面过节的人太多了
It gets crazy out there.

111
00:03:34,700 --> 00:03:37,015
能避开那些纷扰我很开心
I'm happy to avoid the fuss.

112
00:03:37,180 --> 00:03:38,820
有点纷扰也不错
Wouldn't have minded a little fuss.

113
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:42,280
我感觉最近有点被忽视了
Maybe I've been kind of feeling taken for granted lately.

114
00:03:42,560 --> 00:03:43,880
我知道只有小姑娘
I know only girls are

115
00:03:43,880 --> 00:03:46,186
才会在乎什么情人节 但是
supposed to care about Valentine's day, but --

116
00:03:46,275 --> 00:03:47,383
我在哀嚎什么啊
Ah, what am I crying about?

117
00:03:47,383 --> 00:03:49,519
我们赚的钱多 管它呢
We get paid more, so what the hell?

118
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,880
库珀做人太不地道了
Cooper didn't even have the decency

119
00:03:51,880 --> 00:03:54,020
都没给我时间取消派对厨师预约
to leave me in time to cancel the caterer.

120
00:03:54,289 --> 00:03:57,023
如果你有胃口 这有三百只芥末大虾
I have 300 of this wasabi shrimp if you're hungry.

121
00:03:57,140 --> 00:03:57,900
不用了 谢谢
Oh, no, thank you.

122
00:03:57,911 --> 00:03:59,967
沙丁鱼肉酱 橄榄脆吐司
Sardine rillettes, olive crostini --

123
00:03:59,967 --> 00:04:01,384
要怎么才能吃完啊
What am I supposed to do with all of this?

124
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:02,440
卡尔梅利纳 那是给客人吃的
Carmelina, that's for company.

125
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:05,620
小卡来了 我们该走了
Oh, well, there's Cam, so we should probably go.

126
00:04:05,745 --> 00:04:08,010
你离开了好久 我还担心你吵醒了我妈
Oh, you were gone so long, I was afraid you'd woken mother.

127
00:04:08,010 --> 00:04:09,198
妈妈
Uh, m-mother?

128
00:04:09,198 --> 00:04:10,036
我没提到吗
Didn't I mention?

129
00:04:10,320 --> 00:04:12,940
她在这里康复 刚置换了两个髋关节
She's recuperating here, just had both hips replaced.

130
00:04:13,120 --> 00:04:14,180
那提醒了我
Oh, that reminds me --

131
00:04:14,180 --> 00:04:16,000
我该把摄像头安在她房间里
I should put on the security camera in her room.

132
00:04:16,882 --> 00:04:17,870
-你拿到了吗 -拿到了
- Did you get it? - Yes.

133
00:04:17,870 --> 00:04:20,165
猜猜他们把最后送来的结婚礼物放在哪里
And guess where they keep the last-minute wedding gifts?

134
00:04:20,400 --> 00:04:22,480
提示一下 显然你需要原来的髋关节
Hint -- apparently you need your original hips

135
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,660
才能让睡衣合上
to keep a nightgown closed.

136
00:04:23,760 --> 00:04:25,460
很高兴你们过来了
Well, I'm glad you stopped by.

137
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,960
我真的很需要
I really needed this.

138
00:04:28,068 --> 00:04:28,986
小卡 来吧
Oh, Cam, get in here.

139
00:04:28,986 --> 00:04:30,244
我有点鼻塞
Oh, I have a little bit of a sniffle.

140
00:04:30,244 --> 00:04:31,930
来吧
Oh, come on.

141
00:04:33,380 --> 00:04:34,020
这是什么
What's this?

142
00:04:34,555 --> 00:04:36,141
那是...
Uh, that is, um --

143
00:04:36,311 --> 00:04:37,928
送给你和库珀的结婚礼物
That's a wedding gift for you and Cooper,

144
00:04:37,928 --> 00:04:40,003
但我们听说后 就觉得这不合适
but once we heard, we didn't think it was appropriate.

145
00:04:40,003 --> 00:04:40,622
你开玩笑吗
Oh, are you kidding?

146
00:04:40,622 --> 00:04:42,688
收礼物就没有不合适的时候
There's no bad time for a gift.

147
00:04:42,688 --> 00:04:43,606
抱歉 我们送得太晚了
I'm -- I'm sorry it's so late.

148
00:04:43,700 --> 00:04:44,700
我们只是想送你
We just wanted to get you something

149
00:04:44,700 --> 00:04:45,680
你会珍爱的东西
that you would really cherish.

150
00:04:45,751 --> 00:04:47,398
这是我们送出的最棒的礼物
Pretty much the best gift we've ever given anyone.

151
00:04:47,398 --> 00:04:48,875
是啊 这是很漂亮的...
Yeah, it's -- it's a beautiful...

152
00:04:48,875 --> 00:04:51,290
奶酪盘
Cheese plate!

153
00:04:51,619 --> 00:04:53,365
是的 看到这异想天开的措辞
Yes, I got that from the...

154
00:04:53,385 --> 00:04:54,234
我就知道了
whimsical phrasing.

155
00:04:54,234 --> 00:04:55,411
你们确定不留下再喝一杯吗
Are you sure you won't stay for one more,

156
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,200
特别是现在我有了这个
especially now since I've got this

157
00:04:57,800 --> 00:04:59,260
时髦的传送奶酪的系统
stylish cheese-delivery system?

158
00:04:59,443 --> 00:05:00,961
-就一杯 -真棒
- Just one, yeah. - Great.

159
00:05:03,844 --> 00:05:04,284
怎么回事
What happened?!

160
00:05:04,284 --> 00:05:06,767
显然有两个包装得很像的礼物
Obviously there were two gifts wrapped similarly,

161
00:05:06,767 --> 00:05:07,725
而我的眼睛里含着泪水
and my eyes were watering

162
00:05:07,725 --> 00:05:09,731
因为那房间里充斥着药膏味道
from the thick fog of Vaporub back there.

163
00:05:09,731 --> 00:05:10,949
反正我们现在无所畏惧了
Okay, well, we got nothing to lose now,

164
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,260
回去拿那幅画
so go back and get the painting.

165
00:05:12,320 --> 00:05:13,800
你知道谁送了他那个便宜的东西吗
You know who gave him that cheap thing?

166
00:05:13,933 --> 00:05:15,878
杰玛库斯 她赚的第一块钱都还在呢
J'marcus. She's got the first dollar she ever earned --

167
00:05:15,878 --> 00:05:16,808
快去吧
Just go!

168
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,240
桑娅毁了我的情人节之后
Once Sonia blew up my Valentine's Day,

169
00:05:19,260 --> 00:05:21,160
我本可以坐着为自己感到难过
I could have sat around feeling sorry for myself.

170
00:05:21,587 --> 00:05:23,163
但我轻笑了一会儿
Instead, I had a little chuckle,

171
00:05:23,163 --> 00:05:24,810
然后给狗狗买了礼物
and I got the dog a gift.

172
00:05:25,200 --> 00:05:27,960
我知道这很愚蠢 给斯黛拉买礼物
I know it's silly getting Stella a present...

173
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:29,320
她的生日快到了
So close to her birthday.

174
00:05:30,260 --> 00:05:31,220
她在吗
Is she around?

175
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,700
我觉得她在楼上的浴室里
I think she's upstairs in the bath.

176
00:05:33,003 --> 00:05:34,889
什么 我今早刚给她洗过澡
What? I just gave her a bath this morning.

177
00:05:35,787 --> 00:05:37,104
你说的是斯黛拉
Oh, you're talking about Stella.

178
00:05:37,104 --> 00:05:38,701
等等 你给狗狗买了礼物吗
Wait, you got the dog a gift?

179
00:05:38,701 --> 00:05:39,529
你没资格评判我
Lot of attitude

180
00:05:39,529 --> 00:05:40,497
你的约会对象是一桶冰淇淋
for a guy whose date's a tub of

181
00:05:40,497 --> 00:05:42,204
和一条毛绒绒的睡袍
ice cream and a fuzzy robe.

182
00:05:42,214 --> 00:05:44,898
你简直就像《凯西》漫画里的主人公
You're spending Valentine's Day in a "Cathy" cartoon.

183
00:05:45,686 --> 00:05:46,984
这是干什么
Hey, what's all this?

184
00:05:46,984 --> 00:05:47,792
我还以为我们三个
I thought the three of us

185
00:05:47,792 --> 00:05:48,989
就叫点外卖呢
were just gonna order something in.

186
00:05:48,989 --> 00:05:51,295
不 我已经毁了你们的夜晚
No. I ruined your night enough.

187
00:05:51,295 --> 00:05:52,761
我要给你和歌洛莉亚做饭
I'm cooking for you and Gloria

188
00:05:52,980 --> 00:05:55,160
好让你们独自度过浪漫的夜晚
so you can have a romantic evening alone.

189
00:05:55,340 --> 00:05:56,540
桑娅 你没必要这样做
Sonia, you don't have to do this.

190
00:05:56,620 --> 00:05:57,500
我想这样
I want to.

191
00:05:57,600 --> 00:05:59,940
为你们准备食物我觉得很开心
It makes me so happy to prepare food for you.

192
00:06:00,166 --> 00:06:03,319
也许以后我也会给自己的老公做饭
Maybe someday I'll be preparing it for a husband of my own.

193
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,780
谢谢你没有笑到在地上打滚
Thank you for not laughing and falling on the floor

194
00:06:05,780 --> 00:06:07,720
我说这种话时我妈妈就会那样做
like my mother does when I say such things.

195
00:06:09,117 --> 00:06:11,822
今天是情人节 我...
You know, it being Valentine's Day and all, I, uh --

196
00:06:13,180 --> 00:06:14,420
我给你准备了点东西
I got you a little something.

197
00:06:14,700 --> 00:06:15,380
有要洗的衣服吗
Ooh, laundry?

198
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,000
不
No.

199
00:06:17,060 --> 00:06:17,460
给你
Here.

200
00:06:20,140 --> 00:06:21,080
不行
I can't.

201
00:06:21,220 --> 00:06:23,160
来吧 打开
Come on! Open it.

202
00:06:24,036 --> 00:06:25,363
瞧见这个"S"了吗
Here, see that "S" there?

203
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,620
代表桑娅
That's for "Sonia."

204
00:06:30,760 --> 00:06:33,480
杰 好漂亮
Oh, Jay, it's so beautiful.

205
00:06:34,060 --> 00:06:35,440
我不知道该怎么...
I don't know what to...

206
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:36,900
谢谢你
Thank you!

207
00:06:40,971 --> 00:06:41,939
我什么时候会学到教训
When will I learn?

208
00:06:41,939 --> 00:06:44,274
我太吸引小姨子了
I'm catnip to sister-in-laws.

209
00:06:44,284 --> 00:06:47,048
多年前 感恩节晚餐时 我坐在迪迪的姐姐
Years ago, I was sitting next to Dede's sister Cece

210
00:06:47,048 --> 00:06:47,837
西西旁边
at Thanksgiving dinner,

211
00:06:47,837 --> 00:06:49,932
我对她施展了一些魅力
and I threw a little charm her way.

212
00:06:49,932 --> 00:06:51,339
眨了眨蓝眼睛
You know, flash the baby blues.

213
00:06:51,339 --> 00:06:52,856
我还没反应过来
And before I know it,

214
00:06:52,856 --> 00:06:55,281
她就用12码的脚在我的胫骨上摩擦了
she's rubbing her size 12s up and down my shin.

215
00:06:55,281 --> 00:06:56,329
迪迪发现了
Dede caught her,

216
00:06:56,329 --> 00:06:57,716
走去桌子那边跟她打了起来
went over the table at her.

217
00:06:57,716 --> 00:07:00,760
靠她姐碧碧和我才把她俩分开
It took me and her sister Bebe to separate them.

218
00:07:04,800 --> 00:07:05,860
你在哪里
Hey, where are you?

219
00:07:05,860 --> 00:07:07,180
我都给你打了15分钟的电话了
I've been trying you for 15 minutes.

220
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:09,280
我知道 会议延迟了
I know. We ran late.

221
00:07:09,280 --> 00:07:10,400
然后车又没法发动
And then the car wouldn't start,

222
00:07:10,440 --> 00:07:11,400
我不得不打给汽车协会
so I had to call AAA.

223
00:07:11,500 --> 00:07:12,920
他们说在来的路上了 但谁知道呢
They said they're on their way, but who knows?

224
00:07:13,104 --> 00:07:14,082
我急得满脸冒油
I'm all greasy.

225
00:07:14,082 --> 00:07:15,818
亲爱的 我觉得我没法过去了
Oh, honey, I don't think I'm gonna make it.

226
00:07:15,818 --> 00:07:16,826
别生气
Don't be mad.

227
00:07:16,826 --> 00:07:17,654
我很生气
I am mad.

228
00:07:17,654 --> 00:07:19,381
你本该20分钟前到的
You were supposed to be here 20 minutes ago.

229
00:07:19,800 --> 00:07:21,580
这是我们为我俩留出的一夜
This is the one night we set aside for us.

230
00:07:21,660 --> 00:07:23,300
我知道 我觉得很糟糕
I know, and I feel terrible,

231
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:26,160
但是听着 喝完酒 回家去
but listen, finish your drink, come on home.

232
00:07:26,420 --> 00:07:27,900
也许我们可以过个浪漫的复活节
Maybe we'll have a romantic Easter.

233
00:07:30,118 --> 00:07:31,167
买单
Check, please.

234
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:36,380
我听说你妻子的车出了故障
I understand that your wife has had some car trouble.

235
00:07:37,060 --> 00:07:39,560
那是怎么回事啊
I wonder how that could have happened?

236
00:07:46,394 --> 00:07:47,382
我必须说 朱莉安娜
I must say, Juliana,

237
00:07:47,382 --> 00:07:49,488
我今晚绝对没想到会在这里见到你
you're the last person I expected to see here tonight.

238
00:07:49,620 --> 00:07:51,000
如果走运的话
Well, with any luck,

239
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:54,020
你今晚会是我看到的最后一个人
you'll be the last person I do see tonight.

240
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:54,760
天啊
Oh, my God.

241
00:07:55,020 --> 00:07:57,300
菲尔 我注意你好几年了
Phil, I've had my eye on you for years.

242
00:07:57,400 --> 00:07:58,240
我很高兴
I'm just so happy

243
00:07:58,240 --> 00:08:00,020
我们终于能独处一段时间了
we're finally gonna get some alone time.

244
00:08:00,600 --> 00:08:02,060
我没吓到你吧
I'm not scaring you, am I?

245
00:08:02,160 --> 00:08:03,020
恰恰相反
Quite the contrary.

246
00:08:04,060 --> 00:08:04,960
大部分见到我的女人
Most women who meet me

247
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:07,060
立刻就要求跟我独处
almost instantly ask for some alone time.

248
00:08:08,680 --> 00:08:09,560
抱歉
Excuse me.

249
00:08:10,100 --> 00:08:10,540
该死
Darn it!

250
00:08:10,664 --> 00:08:12,081
我带客户看房的事提前到明早了
My showing was pushed up tomorrow morning.

251
00:08:12,081 --> 00:08:14,037
我也许得早点回去
I-I may have to make it an early one.

252
00:08:14,140 --> 00:08:15,140
你确定吗
Are you sure?

253
00:08:15,543 --> 00:08:17,619
因为你跟我只有一晚上的时间 猛虎
'Cause you only have one night with me, tiger,

254
00:08:17,720 --> 00:08:18,920
而我就和
and I'm as flexible

255
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:20,800
政府担保的零首付
as a government-insured, zero-down,

256
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:21,920
浮息按揭一样灵活
variable-rate mortgage.

257
00:08:22,760 --> 00:08:23,680
你到底是谁
Who are you?

258
00:08:24,340 --> 00:08:26,860
不如我们离开这里怎么样
What do you say we get out of here?

259
00:08:26,860 --> 00:08:28,180
-你在干什么 -跑 快跑
- What are you doing? - Run, run!

260
00:08:28,180 --> 00:08:29,320
可这瓶酒还没付钱呢
But we haven't even paid for this.

261
00:08:29,320 --> 00:08:31,380
我们是法外狂徒 宝贝 快跑
We're outlaws, baby. Go, go!

262
00:08:32,380 --> 00:08:34,100
刚才可真是太刺激了
That was such a rush!

263
00:08:34,604 --> 00:08:37,029
你以前从没偷过什么东西吧
You've never stolen anything before?

264
00:08:37,029 --> 00:08:37,897
我只在高中时
Only the entire show

265
00:08:37,897 --> 00:08:39,334
偷了整场《绿野仙踪》表演的风头
of my high-school production of "The wiz,"

266
00:08:39,334 --> 00:08:40,511
不过我认为那不算是...
but I don't think that's --

267
00:08:40,511 --> 00:08:43,575
观光电梯 可以看到绝美的风景了
Oh, glass elevator. Should make for an exciting view.

268
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:45,420
是街上的行人会看到绝美的风景了
It will for the people on the street.

269
00:08:45,820 --> 00:08:46,460
天呐
Oh, my God.

270
00:08:50,610 --> 00:08:51,957
我根本没听见他们上来了
I didn't even hear them get on.

271
00:08:51,957 --> 00:08:54,113
也许你该掏耳朵了
Well, maybe it's time for an ear cleaning.

272
00:08:54,113 --> 00:08:56,318
不用了 你刚才把它们冲得很干净了
I don't know, you just sluiced them out pretty good.

273
00:08:56,380 --> 00:08:57,900
我觉得有点热 菲尔
I'm getting kind of hot, Phil.

274
00:08:58,140 --> 00:09:00,640
你说我们去凉快一下怎么样
What do you say we cool off a bit?

275
00:09:00,849 --> 00:09:02,875
这主意简直太棒了 朱莉安娜
Aw, that would have been great, Juliana.

276
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:04,620
可惜已经天黑了
Too bad it's after...dark.

277
00:09:05,780 --> 00:09:06,180
女巫
Sorceress.

278
00:09:06,980 --> 00:09:08,200
你说得对 朱莉安娜
You were right, Juliana.

279
00:09:08,480 --> 00:09:10,640
这清凉的晚风正是我们所需要的
This cool night air is just the thing.

280
00:09:11,287 --> 00:09:12,405
这位女士需要我的外套吗
Would the lady like my coat

281
00:09:12,405 --> 00:09:14,211
这样就不会感冒...
so she doesn't catch a col--

282
00:09:15,300 --> 00:09:16,660
跟我想的是一样的吗
Does that mean what I think it does?

283
00:09:20,460 --> 00:09:21,440
水有点凉
Water's a little chilly.

284
00:09:21,496 --> 00:09:23,322
你能不能下来帮我暖和一下
Think you can come in here and help me warm it up?

285
00:09:23,322 --> 00:09:26,006
宝贝 还没有我温暖不了的泳池
Baby, they haven't built a pool I couldn't warm a little.

286
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,846
-小卡呢 -又去厕所了
- Where's Cam? - Uh, tinkling again.

287
00:09:30,846 --> 00:09:31,974
大自然召唤得太勤了
Nature calls so often,

288
00:09:31,974 --> 00:09:33,521
可能把他列入快速拨号了
I think she has him on speed dial.

289
00:09:34,289 --> 00:09:35,028
那是什么
Oh, what's that?

290
00:09:35,260 --> 00:09:37,040
我母亲房里的运动检测器警报
The motion-detector alarm in mother's room

291
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,180
为防止她从床上掉下来
in case she falls out of bed.

292
00:09:38,300 --> 00:09:39,560
酒会的时候我把它打开了
I turn it on during cocktails,

293
00:09:39,560 --> 00:09:41,240
害怕自己会忘记她还在那里
when I tend to forget she's even there.

294
00:09:41,474 --> 00:09:43,181
怎么了 她没事吧
What's going on? She all right?

295
00:09:43,181 --> 00:09:44,807
没事 没事 只是在晃腿
Yeah, yeah, she's just tossing her leg a little bit.

296
00:09:44,807 --> 00:09:46,454
又踢腿了吗
Oh, that kicky thing?

297
00:09:46,454 --> 00:09:48,090
她要么是在做梦跳火箭女郎舞
She's either having her rockettes dream

298
00:09:48,090 --> 00:09:49,398
要么就是她的导尿管掉了
or her catheter's out.

299
00:09:50,060 --> 00:09:50,880
她没事
She's fine.

300
00:09:52,761 --> 00:09:54,317
冰块没有了
Oh, we're out of ice!

301
00:09:54,560 --> 00:09:55,780
噩梦不断啊
The nightmare continues!

302
00:09:57,920 --> 00:09:58,300
老天
God.

303
00:10:02,989 --> 00:10:04,576
我找到了
Hey, I got it.

304
00:10:04,576 --> 00:10:05,434
好 快放回去
Okay, put it back.

305
00:10:05,434 --> 00:10:06,981
我一定是听错了吧
I can't possibly have heard you correctly.

306
00:10:06,981 --> 00:10:09,875
那里有个装着圣安杰洛牌玻璃碗的盒子
There is a box over there with a Santangelo glass bowl

307
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,280
是他们准备送我们的结婚礼物
that they got us for our wedding.

308
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,320
一会就说那个奶酪盘只是个笑话
We'll just say that the cheese plate was a little joke

309
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:15,120
真正的礼物在另一个房间里
and that the real present is in the other room.

310
00:10:15,380 --> 00:10:15,740
快去
Hurry!

311
00:10:16,960 --> 00:10:18,820
对了 你们今天来
You know, your coming around today

312
00:10:18,820 --> 00:10:21,320
让我想起库珀和我为你们准备了结婚礼物
reminded me that Cooper and I got you a wedding gift.

313
00:10:21,420 --> 00:10:22,580
是吗
You did?

314
00:10:22,640 --> 00:10:25,240
真是太让我惊喜了
Well, now, this is a surprise.

315
00:10:25,303 --> 00:10:27,249
尽管上面没有标明
Well, even though it doesn't say so on it,

316
00:10:27,249 --> 00:10:29,165
是条鱼 恭喜你们
it's a fish! Congrats.

317
00:10:29,165 --> 00:10:32,368
天呐 塑料的橄榄剑
Oh, my god! Plastic olive swords?

318
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:34,900
卡尔梅利纳 你是想被驱逐出境吗
Carmelina, are you trying to be deported?!

319
00:10:35,480 --> 00:10:36,600
好了 放回去了
All right, I got it back.

320
00:10:37,148 --> 00:10:37,866
那是什么
What is that?

321
00:10:37,866 --> 00:10:39,862
是安德斯给我们的结婚礼物
This is Anders' wedding present to us.

322
00:10:40,200 --> 00:10:41,280
他一定是看到我们送他的
He must have swapped it out

323
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:43,680
那个畸形的东西后把礼物换掉了
when he opened that monstrosity that he thinks we got him.

324
00:10:43,814 --> 00:10:45,022
我们得把画拿回来
We're getting our painting back.

325
00:10:45,022 --> 00:10:46,289
-快去 -我吗
- Go. - Me?

326
00:10:46,289 --> 00:10:47,716
不不 你已经侦察过那个房间了
No, no. You've already done a recon of the room.

327
00:10:48,100 --> 00:10:48,820
你去做
You need to do this.

328
00:10:48,920 --> 00:10:50,520
放轻松 "碟中谍"
Okay, take it easy, "Mission impossible."

329
00:10:50,560 --> 00:10:52,160
那里只有一张床和一个沙发 不是迷宫
It's a bed and a couch, not a laser maze.

330
00:10:52,220 --> 00:10:52,780
快去吧
Now get.

331
00:10:54,931 --> 00:10:57,925
喝点香槟酒 晚饭十分钟就好
A little champagne, and dinner will be ready in 10 minutes.

332
00:10:58,580 --> 00:10:59,340
谢谢
Ay, gracias!

333
00:10:59,591 --> 00:11:02,475
杰 谢谢你给我买的新手镯
Oh, Jay, thank you so much for my new bracelet.

334
00:11:02,475 --> 00:11:03,613
你真是太客气了
You shouldn't have.

335
00:11:03,613 --> 00:11:05,519
说到首饰和"太客气"
And speaking of jewlry and "shouldn't haves,"

336
00:11:05,519 --> 00:11:07,145
我觉得有点对不起桑娅
I was feeling sorry for Sonia,

337
00:11:07,145 --> 00:11:08,413
我给了她一个小玩意
and I gave her a little trinket.

338
00:11:08,413 --> 00:11:09,730
你真好
Oh, that's so sweet.

339
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:12,135
是 但那个可怜的姑娘对我太热情了
Yeah, but now the poor kid's got the hots for me.

340
00:11:12,135 --> 00:11:13,083
我不知道这是为什么
I don't know what it is.

341
00:11:13,083 --> 00:11:14,859
也许我只是不了解自己的魅力所在
Maybe I just don't know my own power.

342
00:11:15,360 --> 00:11:16,660
你一定时常会感觉到吧
I mean, you must get that sometimes.

343
00:11:16,800 --> 00:11:17,580
不要生气啊
Don't be mad.

344
00:11:18,380 --> 00:11:19,960
也不要这样笑 不管是为什么
And don't be whatever that is, either.

345
00:11:20,098 --> 00:11:21,715
她抱着我不肯松手
She hugged me and wouldn't let go.

346
00:11:21,715 --> 00:11:23,072
不是我瞎想
It's not that crazy.

347
00:11:23,072 --> 00:11:24,300
这事以前也发生过
This has happened before.

348
00:11:24,300 --> 00:11:25,168
是啊 迪迪的
Oh, yeah, that time

349
00:11:25,168 --> 00:11:27,663
独居妹妹抱着你腿不放的那次
when Dede's lonely sister grabbed your leg?

350
00:11:27,663 --> 00:11:29,579
不是独居 她是护林员
Not lonely. She's a forest ranger.

351
00:11:29,579 --> 00:11:30,966
她根本冷静不下来
She can't be tied down.

352
00:11:30,966 --> 00:11:33,750
在我回去之前
Look, before I shuffle back to my bell tower,

353
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:35,087
我想说 我知道那种表情
let me just say I know the look.

354
00:11:35,087 --> 00:11:36,484
杰 拜托
Ay, Jay, please.

355
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:37,740
真对不起
I'm so sorry

356
00:11:37,740 --> 00:11:40,320
今天没怎么好好关心你
that I didn't pay attention to you at all today.

357
00:11:40,360 --> 00:11:41,920
你现在都开始胡思乱想了
And now you're all crazy.

358
00:11:42,332 --> 00:11:45,076
歌洛莉亚 我找不到蜡烛台了
Gloria, I can't find the candlesticks!

359
00:11:45,076 --> 00:11:47,272
别担心 我来帮你
Ay, don't worry. I go help you!

360
00:11:50,375 --> 00:11:51,672
歌洛莉亚 你没事吧
Gloria, are you all right?

361
00:11:51,672 --> 00:11:53,000
我的脚踝
My ankle!

362
00:11:53,149 --> 00:11:55,245
乔的玩具怎么会在这里
Why is Joe's toy here?

363
00:11:55,245 --> 00:11:57,061
天呐 你扭到脚了是不是
Oh, gee, you really twisted it, huh?

364
00:11:57,780 --> 00:11:59,480
没事 亲爱的 我去给你拿冰敷一下
All right, honey. Let me get some ice on that.

365
00:11:59,486 --> 00:12:01,492
我听到有人摔倒了 没事吧
I heard a crash. Is everything okay?

366
00:12:01,492 --> 00:12:03,248
是啊 歌洛莉亚扭到脚了
Yeah, Gloria turned her ankle.

367
00:12:03,248 --> 00:12:05,543
我不知道她还能不能下来吃晚饭了
I don't know if she's gonna make it down for dinner.

368
00:12:06,320 --> 00:12:07,120
不
Oh, no!

369
00:12:07,920 --> 00:12:09,240
要我把食物拿到楼上去吗
Should I bring your food upstairs?

370
00:12:09,420 --> 00:12:10,860
不用 她想休息一下
No, she just wants to rest.

371
00:12:10,900 --> 00:12:12,620
她让我跟你在楼下吃
She told me to eat with you downstairs.

372
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:15,080
她不想制造什么...
She doesn't want to make any --

373
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,640
麻烦
...trouble.

374
00:12:17,580 --> 00:12:19,340
那是我有生以来最刺激的一夜
That was the most exciting night of my life.

375
00:12:19,840 --> 00:12:21,440
要是我鼓掌的话会不会破坏气氛
Would it break the mood if I clapped a little?

376
00:12:21,580 --> 00:12:23,120
不会 我可以允许
No, I will allow it.

377
00:12:26,450 --> 00:12:28,555
瞧瞧 这里提供高档的棉签
Ooh, look, they have the good q-tips.

378
00:12:28,555 --> 00:12:30,032
我要偷一把回去
I'm gonna steal us a bunch.

379
00:12:30,032 --> 00:12:31,619
我会想念朱莉安娜的
I'm gonna miss Juliana.

380
00:12:31,619 --> 00:12:33,455
那女人真是无所不知无所不能
That lady knows where the bodies are buried.

381
00:12:33,455 --> 00:12:35,152
谢谢 亲爱的
Oh, thanks, honey.

382
00:12:35,152 --> 00:12:38,096
我知道前几年的情人节我都不是很上心
I know some years I miss the mark on Valentine's Day.

383
00:12:38,096 --> 00:12:39,782
但今年 我想要确保...
This year, I wanted to make sure --

384
00:12:39,782 --> 00:12:42,456
她真是富有冒险精神又让人惊喜
She's just so adventurous and surprising.

385
00:12:42,526 --> 00:12:43,255
就像在我口渴得要命时
It's like I was parched,

386
00:12:43,255 --> 00:12:45,899
她用一大杯惊喜之酒来为我解渴
and she quenched my thirst with a big goblet of "Wow."

387
00:12:46,480 --> 00:12:49,140
我们得确保在下次斟满之前
Well, we'll have to make sure your goblet doesn't get so low

388
00:12:49,140 --> 00:12:50,420
你酒杯里的酒不会变得太少
before we fill her up again.

389
00:12:51,180 --> 00:12:53,100
我没听懂你的意思 但不管怎样
I don't know what that means, but anyway,

390
00:12:53,214 --> 00:12:55,389
我想要不我们回家吧
I'm kind of thinking maybe we'll just go home.

391
00:12:55,479 --> 00:12:56,826
明早我真的要带客户看房
That showing really is early,

392
00:12:56,826 --> 00:12:58,014
我得早点休息
and I need to be sharp.

393
00:12:58,014 --> 00:12:58,852
你确定吗
Are you sure?

394
00:12:58,852 --> 00:12:59,960
我以为你想在这里睡
I thought you wanted to sleep here.

395
00:12:59,960 --> 00:13:01,068
是啊 当时太沉浸于
Yeah, I got caught up

396
00:13:01,068 --> 00:13:02,405
与朱莉安娜的欢愉之中了
in the whole Juliana moment.

397
00:13:03,100 --> 00:13:04,400
可以帮我看看有没有针线包吗
Hey, would you see if there's any sewing kits?

398
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:05,020
家里好像没有了
I think we're out.

399
00:13:05,129 --> 00:13:05,948
好
Yeah.

400
00:13:06,436 --> 00:13:07,734
有什么地方不对劲
Something was off,

401
00:13:07,734 --> 00:13:09,610
但我不太确定是什么
but I couldn't quite put my finger on it.

402
00:13:09,610 --> 00:13:11,246
克莱尔 我们走吧
Claire, let's get a move on!

403
00:13:11,246 --> 00:13:12,743
来了 来了 稍等
I'm coming. I'm coming. Hang on.

404
00:13:12,743 --> 00:13:14,959
瞧瞧谁回来了
Well, look who's back.

405
00:13:15,078 --> 00:13:16,336
是啊 我本来要换衣服的
Yeah, well, I would have changed,

406
00:13:16,336 --> 00:13:17,982
但我只带了这身
but this is all I brought.

407
00:13:17,982 --> 00:13:19,968
换衣服做什么 你穿这身多完美
Change? When you're perfect?

408
00:13:19,968 --> 00:13:22,513
嘴真甜
Oh, that's so nice.

409
00:13:23,280 --> 00:13:24,100
天呐 看看
Oh, my, god, look at that.

410
00:13:24,140 --> 00:13:25,600
都这么晚了 是吧
It really has gotten late, hasn't it?

411
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:26,500
对于你这种
Not for a lady

412
00:13:26,500 --> 00:13:28,540
属于夜晚的女士来说不算晚 朱莉安娜
of the evening like yourself, Juliana.

413
00:13:28,720 --> 00:13:30,746
我们再去观光电梯里亲热一番
What's say we fog up that glass elevator again

414
00:13:30,746 --> 00:13:32,861
再到酒吧喝一杯怎么样
and grab a nightcap in the bar?

415
00:13:35,560 --> 00:13:37,320
然后我知道是什么不对劲了
Then I put my finger on it --

416
00:13:37,780 --> 00:13:39,260
我丈夫爱上了另一个女人
My husband's in love with another woman.

417
00:13:42,880 --> 00:13:45,205
-你很爱吃 是吧 -是啊
- You like that, don't you? - Mmm, yeah.

418
00:13:46,100 --> 00:13:47,120
歌洛莉亚真可怜 是吧
Poor Gloria, though, huh?

419
00:13:47,120 --> 00:13:47,700
她会没事的
She'll be fine.

420
00:13:50,120 --> 00:13:51,220
你嘴上沾了点东西
Oh, you have a little something --

421
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:52,200
这回我自己擦吧
Oh, I'll get it this time.

422
00:13:53,860 --> 00:13:55,120
抱歉
Oh, excuse me.

423
00:13:59,780 --> 00:14:02,460
汤好了 我给歌洛莉亚端上去一点
Oh, the soup is ready. I'll bring some for Gloria.

424
00:14:05,940 --> 00:14:07,380
不是我胡思乱想吧
I'm not crazy, right?

425
00:14:08,307 --> 00:14:10,123
不是 她看上你了
No. She's into you.

426
00:14:10,393 --> 00:14:12,109
谢天谢地你下来了
Thank god you wandered down here when you did.

427
00:14:12,109 --> 00:14:14,444
你看到她总是靠近我了吧
You see how she keeps sliding close to me?

428
00:14:14,444 --> 00:14:15,981
就像在船上吃饭一样
It's like eating on a boat.

429
00:14:15,981 --> 00:14:17,638
比那更糟
It's so much worse than that.

430
00:14:17,638 --> 00:14:19,703
简直和《致命女士》的剧情一样
It's straight out of "Lethal Ladies."

431
00:14:19,703 --> 00:14:21,221
看我在垃圾桶里找到了什么
Look what I found in the trash.

432
00:14:21,729 --> 00:14:23,775
我们的合照 歌洛莉亚的头被剪掉了
Pictures of me and Gloria with Gloria's head cut out?

433
00:14:23,775 --> 00:14:25,591
她就是想除掉妈妈
She literally wants mom out of the picture.

434
00:14:25,591 --> 00:14:26,549
等等
Hold on, amigo.

435
00:14:26,549 --> 00:14:28,725
她迷上我了吗 是的
- Is she infatuated with me? Yes.

436
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:30,200
完全可以理解 无可避免
Understandable, unavoidable.

437
00:14:30,680 --> 00:14:32,780
但她真的会对自己的亲...
But would she actually do something to her own --

438
00:14:33,260 --> 00:14:33,700
怎么了
What?!

439
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:35,700
她刚刚从包里拿出一个瓶子
She just took a bottle out of her purse

440
00:14:35,700 --> 00:14:37,420
往妈妈的汤里撒了点东西
and sprinkled it into mom's soup.

441
00:14:37,500 --> 00:14:40,020
行了 你罪案剧看得太多了
Okay, that's enough of this dumb TV show for you.

442
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:43,100
现在说的是一种完全可信的迷恋
We're talking about a perfectly believable obsession.

443
00:14:43,683 --> 00:14:45,230
你是在把这事编造成一种...
You're trying to make this into something that's --

444
00:14:45,230 --> 00:14:46,359
给 曼尼
Here, Manny.

445
00:14:46,627 --> 00:14:48,463
给我的吗 那杰呢
That's for me? What about Jay?

446
00:14:48,463 --> 00:14:49,940
太辣了 他喝不了
Oh, it's too spicy for him.

447
00:14:49,940 --> 00:14:52,435
我会给你妈妈弄一碗和这碗一样的
I make another one just like yours for your mother.

448
00:14:52,435 --> 00:14:54,102
趁热喝了吧
Eat it while it's hot. Okay.

449
00:14:54,580 --> 00:14:55,400
天呐
Oh, my god.

450
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:57,480
她也想除掉我
She wants me out of the picture, too.

451
00:14:57,800 --> 00:14:58,460
当然了
Of course.

452
00:14:59,251 --> 00:15:00,927
年轻女人遇到个富有的老男人
Young woman meets a wealthy, older man.

453
00:15:00,927 --> 00:15:02,125
谁愿带个碍事的孩子呢
Who wants a kid in the way?

454
00:15:02,125 --> 00:15:04,071
这是你今天说的第一句符合逻辑的话
That's the first airtight thing you've said today.

455
00:15:04,071 --> 00:15:05,977
但她不是谋杀犯
But she's not a murderer

456
00:15:06,366 --> 00:15:07,325
斯黛拉 别喝
Stella, no!

457
00:15:07,354 --> 00:15:08,931
真感人 你倒是愿意让我喝毒药
Oh, that's nice. You'd let me eat the soup.

458
00:15:08,931 --> 00:15:10,169
快弄干净
Just clean it up.

459
00:15:10,940 --> 00:15:12,140
睁开眼看看吧 杰
Open your eyes, Jay.

460
00:15:12,340 --> 00:15:13,760
她想要据你为己有
She wants you all to herself.

461
00:15:13,860 --> 00:15:15,520
穿着像妈妈那样的红裙子
The red dress just like mom's,

462
00:15:15,520 --> 00:15:17,280
害妈妈踩到玩具摔倒
the toy she knew mom would trip on,

463
00:15:17,380 --> 00:15:18,460
把照片里妈妈的头剪掉
the headless pictures?

464
00:15:18,640 --> 00:15:19,520
她是个疯子
She's crazy!

465
00:15:20,980 --> 00:15:22,220
你觉得我是疯子吗
You think I'm crazy?

466
00:15:23,980 --> 00:15:25,900
这是我用剪下来的头像做的
This is what I did with the pictures.

467
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:27,700
我为歌洛莉亚做了这张情人节卡片
I made this Valentine for Gloria.

468
00:15:28,340 --> 00:15:31,220
我向歌洛莉亚借了这条裙子
The dress I borrowed from Gloria

469
00:15:31,220 --> 00:15:32,940
搭配你送我的项链
to go with your pretty necklace.

470
00:15:33,949 --> 00:15:36,264
而那瓶"毒药"是香料
And the "Poison" is guasca,

471
00:15:36,264 --> 00:15:38,349
是我从哥伦比亚带来的
a spice I brought from Colombia.

472
00:15:38,360 --> 00:15:40,000
那个玩具是斯黛拉经常玩的
And there's Stella with the toy.

473
00:15:40,280 --> 00:15:42,060
她总是把玩具弄得到处都是
Which she leaves all over the house.

474
00:15:42,240 --> 00:15:44,140
这之中有些误会
There's been some misunderstanding here,

475
00:15:44,140 --> 00:15:45,620
但如果你可以
but it would be so super

476
00:15:45,620 --> 00:15:47,320
不要告诉别人的话就太好了
if you just wouldn't mention this to --

477
00:15:47,320 --> 00:15:47,680
不告诉我吗
Me?!

478
00:15:47,744 --> 00:15:51,422
她俩嗓门这么大 走路倒是没声音
As loud as these two are, the move like cats.

479
00:15:51,422 --> 00:15:53,598
我在婴儿监听器里都听到了
I heard everything on the baby monitor.

480
00:15:53,598 --> 00:15:56,332
你怎么能那样说我的妹妹
How can you say these things about my sister?

481
00:15:56,332 --> 00:15:58,407
我只是想表示友善 杰
I was just trying to be nice, Jay.

482
00:15:58,817 --> 00:16:01,032
我会叫辆出租车 去机场等我的航班
I will call a cab and wait at the airport.

483
00:16:01,212 --> 00:16:03,786
现在我知道你们一家人怎么看我了
Now I know what your family really thinks of me.

484
00:16:03,786 --> 00:16:04,845
桑娅 等等
Sonia, wait!

485
00:16:06,491 --> 00:16:09,534
一周来我努力化解我和桑娅
I have been working on fixing my relationship with Sonia

486
00:16:09,534 --> 00:16:10,921
之间的矛盾
the whole week,

487
00:16:10,921 --> 00:16:12,967
结果因为你以为自己是性感机器
and because you think you're a sex machine,

488
00:16:12,967 --> 00:16:14,284
你把一切都毁了
you have ruined everything.

489
00:16:14,284 --> 00:16:16,609
抱歉 我去和她谈谈
I'm sorry. I'll talk to her.

490
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:21,380
桑娅 我真是太傻了
Sonia, I'm an idiot.

491
00:16:22,180 --> 00:16:24,860
我今天乱下结论
I jumped to some crazy conclusions today.

492
00:16:25,621 --> 00:16:27,726
也许是因为情人节的缘故
I mean, I could say it's because of Valentine's

493
00:16:27,726 --> 00:16:28,974
或是 我不知道
or, I don't know,

494
00:16:28,994 --> 00:16:30,979
我感觉自己有点被忽视了
me feeling a little neglected,

495
00:16:31,139 --> 00:16:32,666
但我知道你绝对不会
but I know you could never --

496
00:16:32,666 --> 00:16:33,524
吻我
Kiss me.

497
00:16:33,524 --> 00:16:36,139
是的 因为你是我的小姨子
Yes, because you're my sister-in-law and, uh --

498
00:16:37,446 --> 00:16:38,823
我们隐藏得很完美 杰
We hid it perfectly, Jay!

499
00:16:38,823 --> 00:16:39,502
桑娅 等等
Sonia, wait!

500
00:16:39,502 --> 00:16:40,789
我们已经等得够久了
We've waited long enough!

501
00:16:40,789 --> 00:16:43,184
与我共度一晚 你就会忘了她
One night with me, and you'll forget all about her.

502
00:16:43,184 --> 00:16:44,621
她不欣赏你
She doesn't appreciate you.

503
00:16:44,621 --> 00:16:45,928
我听到过你们吵架
I hear how you fight!

504
00:16:45,928 --> 00:16:47,096
我们就那样聊天
That's just how we talk.

505
00:16:47,096 --> 00:16:49,211
放弃吧 杰 我们都
Give in to it, Jay. We both--

506
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:50,100
不
Oh, no.

507
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:55,200
我就知道
I knew it!

508
00:16:55,520 --> 00:16:58,000
你居然想把我从你那偷来的好日子
How dare do you try to steal the life

509
00:16:58,000 --> 00:16:59,260
再偷回去
that I stole from you?!

510
00:16:59,320 --> 00:17:01,180
放手吧 歌洛莉亚 我爱他
Let him go, Gloria! I love him!

511
00:17:01,456 --> 00:17:02,144
永不放手
Never!

512
00:17:02,144 --> 00:17:04,250
他是我丈夫 我更爱他
He's my husband, and I love him more!

513
00:17:04,250 --> 00:17:07,254
女士们 别闹了
Ladies, ladies, stop.

514
00:17:11,844 --> 00:17:13,002
你是谁
W-who are you?

515
00:17:13,002 --> 00:17:15,028
我 我是你儿子的朋友
I-I-I'm a friend of you son's.

516
00:17:15,280 --> 00:17:17,220
谢天谢地
Oh, thank goodness.

517
00:17:17,580 --> 00:17:19,960
我扭到脖子了 我需要枕头
I twisted my neck, and I need my pillow.

518
00:17:20,180 --> 00:17:20,920
我很难受
I'm in agony.

519
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:24,820
老妈搬进来确实不方便
Yes, mother moving in was inconvenient,

520
00:17:24,840 --> 00:17:27,120
但要我怎么做 就这么不管她吗
but what did he want me to do, just get rid of her?

521
00:17:27,120 --> 00:17:27,860
谁会干那种事啊
Who does that?

522
00:17:27,940 --> 00:17:30,260
魔鬼才会那么干
I mean, a ghoul, that's who.

523
00:17:31,972 --> 00:17:33,828
-哦不 -怎么了
- Oh, no! - What's wrong?

524
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,560
没什么 我只是在重温
Nothing. I was just reliving the moment

525
00:17:36,560 --> 00:17:37,880
你说你和库珀分手了的那一刻
you told us about you and Cooper.

526
00:17:38,560 --> 00:17:39,700
你太贴心了
You're so dear.

527
00:17:40,315 --> 00:17:43,847
其实 我给你和米奇尔的那条鱼
You know that, that fish I gave you and Mitchell?

528
00:17:43,847 --> 00:17:45,973
那不是我们给你们选的礼物
That really wasn't the gift we picked out for you.

529
00:17:45,973 --> 00:17:47,979
-真的吗 -我只是故意整你们的
- Really? - No, I was just being mean.

530
00:17:47,979 --> 00:17:50,753
只是当我看到那个奶酪盘的时候 我
It's just that, when I saw that cheese plate, I just --

531
00:17:50,843 --> 00:17:52,141
等等
Wait a minute. Did--

532
00:17:52,210 --> 00:17:54,076
你们送那个给我们是因为库珀和我
did you give us that because Cooper and I

533
00:17:54,076 --> 00:17:56,890
提起过要开个奶酪店吗
talked about opening up a little cheese shop?

534
00:17:56,920 --> 00:17:58,240
是啊 不然呢
Yes! Why else?

535
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,640
太贴心了
How sweet!

536
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:01,840
卡尔梅利纳可能都要到家了
Carmelina's probably halfway home with it,

537
00:18:01,840 --> 00:18:04,000
但我可以叫她拿回来
but I can make her walk back.

538
00:18:05,660 --> 00:18:06,520
这个
And this...

539
00:18:07,840 --> 00:18:08,900
这是给你们的
This is for you.

540
00:18:08,980 --> 00:18:11,140
我们很为你们高兴
We really were so happy for you.

541
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,340
安德斯
Oh, Anders.

542
00:18:12,660 --> 00:18:15,680
我们该走了 不过看看是谁起床了
Well, we should probably get going, but look who is up.

543
00:18:16,400 --> 00:18:17,480
妈妈 你的帽子呢
Mother, where's your hat?

544
