548
00:18:24,273 --> 00:18:26,648
你们也该在家里摆点像样的东西了
It's about time you boys had something pretty in the house.

549
00:18:29,253 --> 00:18:30,252
你没事
Oh, you're fine.

550
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:31,180
我爱你
I love you.

551
00:18:34,500 --> 00:18:36,320
当你丈夫注意到另一个女人
Your husband's noticing another woman,

552
00:18:36,460 --> 00:18:38,040
你要做的只有一件事
there's only one thing to do --

553
00:18:38,400 --> 00:18:39,580
再接再厉
step up your game.

554
00:18:40,020 --> 00:18:41,900
我迫不及待地想要泡个热水澡
I just can't wait to get in a hot bath

555
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:43,360
泡泡我感染了的脚趾甲
and soak this infected toenail.

556
00:18:44,420 --> 00:18:46,340
诋毁另一个女人就完事了
It's much easier just to take the other bitch down.

557
00:18:47,375 --> 00:18:50,458
