they turned off the electricity.

562
00:19:04,560 --> 00:19:07,520
这让我们能够制造自己的电流
Leaving us to generate our own electricity.

563
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:10,020
其实蜡烛会非常助兴
Although, candles can be nice

564
