because he's this big, dreamy country bumpkin

573
00:19:28,110 --> 00:19:30,275
而她美丽又年轻
and she is the shiny, new thing.

574
00:19:30,275 --> 00:19:32,451
但电影结束后
But what happens when the movie is over,

575
00:19:32,451 --> 00:19:34,666
当他真正了解她后 会发生什么
when he really gets to know her?

576
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,660
在卡茨基尔待上两周 他就会说
Two weeks out of the Catskills, and it's,

577
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:37,720
你又穿这衣服了 芭比
"You wearing that again, Baby?

578
00:19:37,960 --> 00:19:39,480
你又借我的剃须刀了 芭比
You borrow my razor again, Baby?

579
00:19:39,740 --> 00:19:41,940
两杯酒还不够多吗 芭比
Isn't two glasses enough, Baby?"

580
