I should probably let her know that more often than I do.

596
00:20:15,320 --> 00:20:16,000
是我的错
That's my bad.

597
00:20:17,387 --> 00:20:18,016
但重点是
But, point is,

598
00:20:18,280 --> 00:20:19,380
如果一个男人能找到这么好的老婆
a guy like me gets that lucky,

599
00:20:19,660 --> 00:20:20,300
